updatedAt":"2026-05-01T20:01:20.675Z"},"messages":[{"id":"cmobjxfwb0001f791wx962mih","conversationId":"cmo78ccap0007m3hcx8dymsuu","senderType":"agent","message":"Para asegurar que su gestión quede debidamente registrada en nuestro sistema,** Le sugerimos enviar su documentación por este medio** para garantizar su registro inmediato en el sistema.** Tome en cuenta que, si sus archivos son muy pesados, es posible que el sistema limite la carga,** de ser así, favor de notificarnos para asistirle.","fileUrl":null,"fileType":null,"fileName":null,"isRead":true,"createdAt":"2026-04-23T18:03:07.067Z"}]},{"id":"cmo792rc5001j141wxmgbtfoo","userEmail":"ia8835215@gmail.com","userName":"Luis Aguilar Hernández","userPhone":"2227148039","status":"active","assignedToId":"cmnsy3xqk0000vkeklu9n9e2f","assignedAt":"2026-04-20T17:48:15.103Z","createdAt":"2026-04-20T17:48:14.658Z","updatedAt":"2026-04-22T19:43:12.092Z","leadId":"cmoa22hkq001kks3ke1ms2toe","assignedTo":{"id":"cmnsy3xqk0000vkeklu9n9e2f","email":"rebecagonzalezmx20@gmail.com","password":"$2b$10$a/WaWHXjf3oxdz9VCXqD0Oj.7oYlpVOQarn0DBfi4WLqa954ySWq2","name":"Rebeca González ","role":"agent","isActive":true,"color":"blue","createdAt":"2026-05-01T20:01:20.675Z","updatedAt":"2026-05-01T20:01:20.675Z"},"messages":[{"id":"cmoa82aqf0003bcxfbdmyfnyb","conversationId":"cmo792rc5001j141wxmgbtfoo","senderType":"agent","message":"https://caja-valladolid.vercel.app/formulario-documentos/9407b596-4824-4323-bdb2-0e22ce0f509d","fileUrl":null,"fileType":null,"fileName":null,"isRead":true,"createdAt":"2026-04-22T19:43:12.088Z"}]},{"id":"cmo7134up0004gi87n12a8cmz","userEmail":"aracelizaqa@hotmail.com","userName":"Araceli zavala Quintin","userPhone":"5517912984","status":"active","assignedToId":"cmnsy3xqk0000vkeklu9n9e2f","assignedAt":"2026-04-20T14:04:35.494Z","createdAt":"2026-04-20T14:04:35.281Z","updatedAt":"2026-04-27T23:52:44.454Z","leadId":"cmo712b4k0001gi87sftcfr38","assignedTo":{"id":"cmnsy3xqk0000vkeklu9n9e2f","email":"rebecagonzalezmx20@gmail.com","password":"$2b$10$a/WaWHXjf3oxdz9VCXqD0Oj.7oYlpVOQarn0DBfi4WLqa954ySWq2","name":"Rebeca González ","role":"agent","isActive":true,"color":"blue","createdAt":"2026-05-01T20:01:20.675Z","updatedAt":"2026-05-01T20:01:20.675Z"},"messages":[{"id":"cmohm6gtb000127kcqa3ipso2","conversationId":"cmo7134up0004gi87n12a8cmz","senderType":"agent","message":"**Reciba un cordial saludo.**\n\n**Tras realizar la verificación correspondiente en nuestro portal**, le informamos que aún no hemos recibido los documentos requeridos para su trámite. Es posible que los archivos que intenta adjuntar superen el tamaño máximo de carga permitido por la plataforma.\n\n**Ante esta situación, le sugerimos lo siguiente:**\n\nVerificar los parámetros de carga **(formato y peso del archivo)** establecidos en el sistema.\n\nEn caso de persistir el inconveniente, puede enviarlos directamente a través de este chat. Al hacerlo, los documentos quedarán registrados automáticamente en nuestro sistema para su gestión.\n\n**Quedamos atentos a su envío para dar continuidad a su proceso.**","fileUrl":null,"fileType":null,"fileName":null,"isRead":true,"createdAt":"2026-04-27T23:52:44.382Z"}]},{"id":"cmo795ucy000urjzx20ltm5o7","userEmail":"erickmillan330@gmail.com","userName":"Erick Ramírez millan","userPhone":"7299480454","status":"active","assignedToId":"cmnsy3xqk0000vkeklu9n9e2f","assignedAt":"2026-04-20T17:50:38.692Z","createdAt":"2026-04-20T17:50:38.464Z","updatedAt":"2026-04-20T17:50:55.079Z","leadId":"cmo5w93jx0005tebcforv53hb","assignedTo":{"id":"cmnsy3xqk0000vkeklu9n9e2f","email":"rebecagonzalezmx20@gmail.com","password":"$2b$10$a/WaWHXjf3oxdz9VCXqD0Oj.7oYlpVOQarn0DBfi4WLqa954ySWq2","name":"Rebeca González ","role":"agent","isActive":true,"color":"blue","createdAt":"2026-05-01T20:01:20.675Z","updatedAt":"2026-05-01T20:01:20.675Z"},"messages":[{"id":"cmo796737001om3hcp83vcizl","conversationId":"cmo795ucy000urjzx20ltm5o7","senderType":"agent","message":"https://caja-valladolid.vercel.app/fo